  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/news\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</a> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the admit card for the post of Statistical Officer. </span></span>This&nbsp;<span class=\"google-anno-t\">recruitment</span> was released for 113 posts. Applications for Rajasthan RPSC Statistical Officer <span class=\"google-anno-t\">Recruitment</span> 2025 were accepted from 28 October 2025 to 26 November 2025. The written examination is going to be conducted in 30 October 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their RPSC Statistical Officer Admit Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RPSC Statistical Officer Admit Card 2025</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RPSC SI Advt No 11/2025-26</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>14 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>28 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>26 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>26 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>30 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>24 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>27 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, Other State : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>600/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC, BC : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>400/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>400/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Charge : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>500/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC Statistical Officer Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 January 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RPSC Statistical Officer Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #0000ff; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC Statistical Officer 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 113 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.8831%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.8831%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Statistical Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">42</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">10</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">24</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">MBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">05</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">18</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">14</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RPSC Statistical Officer Online Form 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">At least second class Master’s degree in Economics,<strong>&nbsp;or</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">At least second class Master’s degree in Statistics,<strong>&nbsp;or</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">At least second class Master’s degree in Mathematics with paper in Statistics,<strong>&nbsp;or</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">At least second class Master’s degree in Commerce with Statistics,<strong>&nbsp;or</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">At least second class M.Sc (Agriculture) Statistics from a University established by law in India or Foreign qualifications recognized as equivalent therto by the Government.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">A certificate (RS-CIT course conducted by Rajasthan Knowledge Corporation Limited) awarded by Vardhaman Mahaveer Open University, Kota or any other certificate awarded by a competent authority declared equivalent to above certificate by the Department of Information, Technology and Communication, Government of Rajasthan</span>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download RPSC Statistical Officer Admit Card 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their RPSC Statistical Officer Admit Card candidates are required to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their RPSC Statistical Officer Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates need to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration No. /Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>DOB/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to check their RPSC Statistical Officer Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also check their RPSC Statistical Officer Admit Card from official site of the RPSC.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC Statistical Officer Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://recruitment.rajasthan.gov.in/rectlogingetadmitcard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Link 1</a> | <a href=\"https://sso.rajasthan.gov.in/signin?encq=6JkTF7D/fPuyiLpqlTuv+tsssIL22cKEce/qYZMZKsM=\" tar