<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Important Question</strong></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Q. Has the RPSC Statistical Officer Admit Card 2026 been released?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Yes the RPSC Statistical Officer Admit Card 2026 has been released.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. When was the RPSC Statistical Officer Admit Card 2026 officially announced?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>The RPSC Statistical Officer Admit Card 2026 has issued on 27 August 2026 by RPSC.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. When will the RPSC Statistical Officer exam be held?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.</strong> The CCI Various Post written examination will be conducted on <strong>30 August 2026</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. Where can I check the RPSC Statistical Officer Admit Card 2026?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>You can check it on the official RPSC website: <strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Q. What details are required to download the admit card?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Candidates need their&nbsp;<strong>Registration Number / Roll Number</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Password / Captcha</strong> to download the exam city details.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is RPSC Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of RPSC is https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/news</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
